{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "6292ea30d62c4107c1c4c39d58ba9346ec8f693603eb9ced90783297e58ddeb2", "ja": "琴葉の場合：私が輝く場所", "zh": "琴叶的情况：我绽放光芒的场所", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c688c3e28a92aaf0985368930eb422b6e51b027103b7d38a337e2bc7fe30f801", "ja": "琴葉は舞台に出演している瞬間を選択し、\n亜利沙に撮影を依頼。撮ってもらった写真に\n満足した琴葉は、亜利沙自身の一枚も楽しみ\nだと告げるものの、亜利沙は自分の一枚を\nどうするべきか悩んでいることを告白する。", "zh": "琴叶选择了自己登台演出的瞬间，请亚利沙帮忙拍照。拍好的照片让琴叶十分满意，她还表示也很期待亚利沙自己的那一张，不过亚利沙却坦白说，自己正烦恼着该怎么处理那张照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "630d06d688a821035334a4903a326dd39766e6ae7cf820a02b34bd44c985f8f8", "ja": "（今日は琴葉の舞台出演がある。\n出番は短いが、大事な役どころだ）", "zh": "（今天是琴叶出演舞台剧的日子。虽然出场时间很短，但可是个重要的角色）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "faf81785ab68e1d63d0a73fcda5203fe6a132b3308867b22a97c1d0ff594c51d", "ja": "い、いいんですかっ！？　ありさが、\n琴葉ちゃんの出演中に撮影しても！？", "zh": "真、真的可以吗！？亚利沙在\n琴叶登台演出的时候拍照也可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "db0ae7d21be1aa1080e7111f3479b966a3f6fa5717fe3f4e72d30581710941c3", "ja": "うん。私の最高の一枚を撮るなら、やっぱり\nお芝居をしている時以外は考えられなくて。", "zh": "嗯。如果要拍下我最好的一张照片，果然还是得选我演戏的时候，除此之外我想不到别的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "9da8298fa6209c96aa451dc5daf736ebb0b554fe47290bd6a8b5b3f24ad561a6", "ja": "関係者のみなさんからも、\nちゃんと許可はもらってるから。", "zh": "我也已经从各位相关工作人员那里，获得正式许可了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "34269b24306a16e3cadaa1307fd963c4535ba7a7a07f8efc05571f425e4f9c9e", "ja": "ただし、はしゃいで舞台の邪魔はしちゃだめだぞ。\nカメラのフラッシュも禁止だ。", "zh": "不过，可别太兴奋，妨碍舞台演出啊。\n相机闪光灯也禁止使用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "ec24ca349fa1930c4c27905f55873fc620fbdbcb0c8e46df6d5327ad6e9238c2", "ja": "もちろんです。ルールとマナーを守ってこその推し活…\nではなく、劇場の撮影担当ですから。……ムフフ♪", "zh": "那是当然。遵守规矩和礼仪才是合格的追星……\n不对，因为我是剧场的摄影担当嘛。……嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5ed8a03841639fc296c702c9c169b8ee921fa6ec5b7dfa38d4e3f1ecf90ae928", "ja": "あとうるさくしたり、興奮したり、奇声をあげたり、\n我を忘れたりとか、そういうのもダメだからな？", "zh": "还有不能吵闹、兴奋过头、发出怪叫、\n忘乎所以什么的，这些也都不行哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "02d6ca977d216e814cd83360bcb6792c8b0ead9aa1b890883b2afe7073d17bb9", "ja": "し、しませんってば！　いくらありさでも、\nいえ、ありさだからこそ、TPOは弁えてます！", "zh": "才、才不会那样啦！不管怎么说我也是亚利沙，不对，正因为是亚利沙，才更懂得分清场合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a4cb35bae8d5b4c6e7591727e814d0cc1169dfd5fbc74844fbca57e3e9b15fff", "ja": "そうか。ならいいんだ。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "f84adf51cc7fae0ca027628c911f209bb67e8eb0198fcc17aee553c28fc3b74a", "ja": "弁えてます！", "zh": "我有分寸的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "18402afaa5ad2ac047ac03b11ae86d397986ef5197a0f9d6494b9fecc0bc0055", "ja": "なんで2回言った？", "zh": "为什么要说2遍？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "c8e7eeb77a8803587cedc3463b5a725649ba6737252950ebf13b113571f717b0", "ja": "撮ってもらった写真、\n決めの表情の角度とか、全部すごく良かった。", "zh": "拍下来的照片，每一张在定格表情的角度等方面都特别棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "f808000b71a15ca471c2ec79856547726e0e12c38527b8a0861355255d397d13", "ja": "あの中から選ばせてもらうね。\n亜利沙に頼んでよかった。ありがとう！", "zh": "那我就从里面挑吧。幸好拜托了亚利沙。谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "42ec8a4e474519fe598bdf17fddcc5e18ad30f9e882c98742d1ab55711704568", "ja": "こちらこそ、琴葉ちゃんを好きに撮らせてもらえて、\nもう最高でした♪", "zh": "我才要谢谢你，能让我尽情拍琴叶，真是太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "e3ec629c9466e81b33c04e386ea2248fc2b21c2666015b9cedc0fa6eb951a23a", "ja": "亜利沙の一枚も、楽しみにしてるね。\nふふ、どういうところを切り取るのかな……。", "zh": "亚利沙的那张照片，我也很期待哦。\n呵呵，她会捕捉怎样的瞬间呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "7ee2a1b97656c493e44907383dbc12f6f39cd1c042b76f00aca8b4e07f35b8c2", "ja": "……。\nありさの一枚、ですか……。", "zh": "……。\n亚利沙的照片，吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "3648c2b917369e407b9451fc6abba3b722ff8a998f7d82ff5517ff1a81c2ffdc", "ja": "人手が必要な時はいつでも声をかけて。\nみんなも手伝ってくれると思う。", "zh": "需要人手的时候，随时叫我。\n我想大家也都会来帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "f663135c18f369423c3c61bbde9b497c26463e7e503f5d4088b6e81ac65e62fb", "ja": "は、はい……。\nあの、ありがとうございますっ。", "zh": "好、好的……  \n那个，谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1020_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "e9717afe809d771ad96832c6400633a74953f8f7b622c3dd87bf608b35456cea", "ja": "はぁ。", "zh": "唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a3a47fb12f2ad9fa7d8dce6de6cb63a348eac1d97c276d3fe10c89633f1d045e", "ja": "亜利沙は、まだ自分の撮影プランを\n決めかねてるみたいだな。", "zh": "看来亚利沙还没决定好自己的拍摄方案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "c88bb32d4929295f1d6b5ebe03d40c0cfbfa98e281074c2038291e493cfe3807", "ja": "そう、ですね……。\nずっとみなさんのお手伝いをして、改めて思いました。", "zh": "是啊……我一直帮大家拍摄，重新意识到了这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "bceeb3d81ec224b9f67b401f3046bd137dafd31db5023adad6d3386c025d220f", "ja": "やっぱり、ありさは撮られるより\n撮るほうが、向いてるんだな、って……。", "zh": "亚利沙果然还是比起被拍，\n更适合去拍别人呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a5b585db86f9ad57a02a10365ad29261d1d5449b41ed4b2a26a1423eb029c9e3", "ja": "亜利沙……。", "zh": "亚利沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1026_p", "source_sha256": "d1395cfe7514f67aa0930050052296b197f27e8164a8c3fa35026dda3a75ac41", "ja": "いっとくけど、辞退とかはダメだぞ？", "zh": "先跟你说好，可不许弃权哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "0460bba40dd9c6abe304bae50abbc6e956c8a2514163c377df0ac6c9e1765c18", "ja": "ギクッ！　そ、そんなことしませんよ？\n……みなさんを、ガッカリさせたくないですから。", "zh": "吓！才、才不会做那种事呢？\n……我不想让大家失望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "a45cb8b9d92f8850732e553b9b384bc355cbc86439f5057caf02fa57196e3d7c", "ja": "でも……。", "zh": "可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a4257553f062570d144a4df244308bd007b433f9850b9d4e3925f8dd572b48a0", "ja": "でも？", "zh": "但是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "a743104fc98c1f4025d4563dbbc8eb54e99cdc3044120bd03d4cea0880275d69", "ja": "ありさは少しずつ、本当に少しずつですけど、その……\n前に進むたびに……。", "zh": "亚利沙一点一点，真的只是一点一点，不过，那个……\n每当向前迈出一步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "8e5fbfbcc1ecf287b57acd7121b27078716e9051bd3206116a6a515c8cf66302", "ja": "ちゃんとアイドルちゃんに、近づけてるって思います。\n近づいて、しまっているというか……。", "zh": "我觉得，自己正在一点一点地，真的只是一点一点地，成为真正的偶像。\n或者说……不知不觉间，已经越来越接近了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "b9d249e5fe3421e0500664d83a0fc8a1f4e67c3d3d7ae3da76461b2ceeda8a9e", "ja": "それは、いいことなんじゃないか？", "zh": "那不是件好事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "9a7cb4ad09ac3c3c3b0482050e66b6d19e160f29c0887653c2a57c77ca26c59c", "ja": "でもでも、困るんですよぉ！　ありさの一枚、\nオタ芸してる時の写真にしようと思ったのに……。", "zh": "可是可是，这样会很困扰的啦！我本来想把有纱的一张照片选成跳宅艺时拍的那张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "3da7c66f5a4eb8d1370067cb96e5e5218dd156a211bf1dfb896030a1e2c98f08", "ja": "本当に、その一枚でいいのか悩んじゃいまして……。", "zh": "真的要用那一张吗……我有点苦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "aa48344a80497b386ab8dc6b65edc359cdaed4c9881cf7ddca5d6c16b3d8b6ea", "ja": "アイドルオタク全開のありさは、確実にありさです！\n推しを応援している時は、誇れる自分です！", "zh": "完全释放偶像宅属性的亚利沙，才是真正的亚利沙！  \n为推的偶像加油时，我觉得自己特别值得骄傲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "b93bfbad6bdd136ceeed7224e5a72b9c01487b1e21279afee17c5520afe5995c", "ja": "でもアイドルのありさは、誰かに……\n推してもらっているわけでして……。", "zh": "不过，作为偶像的有里莎，是被某个人……  \n支持着的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "627ca921346ee90bbacfc919f3e7712f11d37383c5eb868fbb0f2ea8ac21bfcc", "ja": "といっても！　決してありさがみなさんと、神聖な\nアイドルちゃんたちと同列と言いたいのではなく！", "zh": "话虽如此！我绝不是说亚利沙要和各位以及神圣的偶像们相提并论！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1039_028ari", "source_sha256": "a678ff53ad0861790ae6367f8c73a7f3b5de0066967b940ef16544b69711c8f2", "ja": "あ、だから……『そこ』なんですよね……。\nアイドルのありさを冷静に分析するのは難しくて……。", "zh": "啊，所以……就是“那里”对吧……。\n要冷静地分析作为偶像的亚利沙，实在很难……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1040_028ari", "source_sha256": "2027c26d4156a4e47f60c93e507ca5112ab645f30e964eaa56b20a3a724ea2d2", "ja": "なので、どうしても「これ！」と言える\n自己肯定感爆アゲな一枚は、まだとても……。", "zh": "所以，无论如何，要说哪张是“这个！”、能让自我肯定感暴涨的照片，现在还实在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "f7e8f02c8fb044f6348e626efdf43e3b026aa9ddf3c386718e3d0fdf4d9acdb5", "ja": "なるほどな。\n……うん、よかった。", "zh": "原来如此。\n……嗯，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1042_028ari", "source_sha256": "7a9678b57a9b32a296822cf43e8e0cbe164e1da632c7a3dac7629a514615fb64", "ja": "よかった？\nあの、よかったというのは……？", "zh": "太好了？\n那个，您说的太好了是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "7045c088290317dbea28f106ae9027d39acf46f8d9abf490bea54668668a96da", "ja": "その話を聞けただけでも、\nこの企画を考えてよかったと思って。", "zh": "光是能听到你说这些，我就觉得提出这个企划真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1044_028ari", "source_sha256": "f5b129ff986bbce349f8ee8c58a194dc1ad1e81328f69cb3c21f63b54a4dbec4", "ja": "全然よくないんですけど！？\n悩みを一生懸命話したんですけど！？", "zh": "一点都不好吧！？\n我可是拼命把烦恼说出来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "7604e8d3b817fa417df8103283bde178a79cfb668189e78a31950db7bbf14ad0", "ja": "そんな相談をされた後に言うのもなんだけど、\nエミリーからも撮影をお願いされてるんだ。", "zh": "虽然现在说这话不太合适，但艾米莉也拜托我帮忙拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1046_p", "source_sha256": "2d9bfb496dcae98179c07078aec5024847b02bc1af0707f395042644bcc0a2c9", "ja": "悩んでるところ悪いが、\nもし可能なら撮影のため一緒に……。", "zh": "抱歉在你烦恼的时候说这个，如果可以的话，能不能一起去拍摄……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_04_1047_028ari", "source_sha256": "0b4a4c445d916f23ea97a96b4072defd14a7efb203d624d1493636a54c92afab", "ja": "わかりました、今すぐ行きましょう！", "zh": "知道了，我们这就去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
